ser":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"無理だった","ts":"1634084234.306500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h=L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91bf58d5-c6a6-4642-8a5b-2a02c8650dbf","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`mv *.{new,}`で行けないかな？","ts":"1634083964.306100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P7yE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1d5f034-8d38-40ee-b2a4-6923409a2c91","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"昨日の夜はEmacsでコマンドを矩形編集で直接編集してそれを直接流しましたw","ts":"1634083450.305000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"icH5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99606d37-dba3-4af4-b484-c7667322b39e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"フォルダ分けるの正解そう。なるほど。","ts":"1634083384.304200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tii09"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8173a1ed-1508-4cb2-92f6-6284e3d907e2","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"new/ 以下に .new なしで作っておけば mv new/* . するだけ。zsh だったら zmv -f '(*).new' '${1}'。","ts":"1634075977.303700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Ed"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1141f3fc-3ccf-474e-988d-4fc3bc2a3935","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"```-rw-r--r-- 1 conao conao  392044 Oct 13 03:30 SKK-JISYO.assoc\n-rw-r--r-- 1 conao conao  392044 Oct 13 03:36 SKK-JISYO.assoc.new\n-rw-r--r-- 1 conao conao   10606 Oct 13 03:14 SKK-JISYO.china_taiwan\n-rw-r--r-- 1 conao conao    9641 Oct 13 03:36 SKK-JISYO.china_taiwan.new```\nこういう `*` に対して `*.new` というファイルを作って、改めて元のファイルに上書きするのってどうやったらスマートにできるんでしょう？\n```mv SKK-JISYO.assoc.new SKK-JISYO.assoc\nmv SKK-JISYO.china_taiwan.new SKK-JISYO.china_taiwan```\nとかいうのを.newが付いてるファイルについて連続実行したい。。","ts":"1634064015.301700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z/KFb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"199f8f8d-f3cc-4786-b52c-df2ca3addd60","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"zcompile の行は if block に入れなくてもよかったかも。","ts":"1634053017.301200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ei/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82ad617d-c2bc-4aa0-924f-b02fe446571d","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"• dump ファイルの更新時間が24時間以内の場合は security check をスキップ (`-C`)\n• compiled dump file (*.zwc) が無い or 古かったらコンパイル (`zcompile`)\n• コンパイルはバックグラウンドで行う","ts":"1634052668.300500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HcLV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C7DF63F0-2564-4808-8EFF-9A49110817AB","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"読めなすぎてすごい","ts":"1634052519.298400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2yJ0x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"424147fe-e884-4a30-a26f-7a632c77fd3b","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"```() {\n  autoload -Uz compinit\n  : ${ZSH_COMPDUMP:=${XDG_CACHE_HOME:-$HOME/.cache}/zsh/compdump-$HOSTNAME-$ZSH_VERSION}\n  local dump=$ZSH_COMPDUMP\n  local dumpc=${dump}.zwc\n  # re-check dump file that are older than 24 hours\n  if [[ -n $dump(#\u003chttp://qN.mh|qN.mh\u003e+24) ]]; then\n    compinit -i -d \"$dump\"\n    { rm -rf \"$dumpc\" \u0026amp;\u0026amp; zcompile \"$dump\" } \u0026amp;!\n  else\n    compinit -C -d \"$dump\"\n    { [[ ! -s $dumpc || $dump -nt $dumpc ]] \u0026amp;\u0026amp; rm -rf \"$dumpc\" \u0026amp;\u0026amp; zcompile \"$dump\" } \u0026amp;!\n  fi\n}```","ts":"1634052205.297100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H42"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AB03665A-45AF-4138-81D3-957DFD50FD04","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"compinitのキャッシュってどうやってます？","ts":"1634051185.296800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"skZ7o"}]}]
